Goldwagen operates through more than 130 franchised outlets, supported by one of the largest dedicated automotive parts warehouses of its kind in Gauteng, which keeps stock levels consistent across a wide geographic footprint. Operating from its distribution base in Louwlardia, Centurion, Worldwide Automotive Group supplies Goldwagen franchise stores and their customers across the region.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.goldwagen.com/', '$[#]', 'https://za.africabz.com/gauteng/worldwide-automotive-group-70750'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'worldwide-automotive-group-bronberrik' AND description = 'Worldwide Automotive Group is the distributor and franchisor behind the Goldwagen Group, an automotive replacement-parts network founded in 1992 that supplies original-equivalent parts for brands including Audi, BMW, Ford, Toyota and VW through around 100 franchised outlets, operating from its distribution warehouse in Louwlardia, Centurion.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
